          <li>No commitment required — the first conversation is always free</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section style="padding: 80px 48px; background: var(--gray);">
  <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 12px;">Common Questions</div>
    <h2 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: clamp(36px,4vw,52px); letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--black); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 48px;">BEFORE YOU <span style="color: var(--orange);">HIT SEND</span></h2>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;">

      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
          Is there a minimum headcount or campaign size?
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 300;">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px;">No minimum. We deploy from a single outlet to 100+ locations simultaneously. Whether you need one promoter for a weekend sampling or a 300-strong team for a national launch, the process is the same.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
          How fast can you deploy from brief to first shift?
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 300;">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px;">Typically 5–7 business days for new campaigns, 2–3 days for repeat clients already set up on BLINK. Rush deployments can be arranged — just flag your timeline in the brief and we'll confirm feasibility in the first call.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
          What's included in the price — any hidden fees?
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 300;">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px;">Proposals are all-in: promoter fees, ops management, BLINK platform access, training coordination, and reporting. The only variable is logistics (warehousing, delivery, POSM fabrication) which is quoted separately when applicable. No surprises at invoice.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
          What happens if a promoter doesn't show up on the day?
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 300;">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px;">BLINK tracks attendance in real time — our ops team is alerted the moment a check-in is missed. Same-day replacements from our 1,000+ roster are part of our standard deployment commitment. You won't be left with an empty booth.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0; cursor: pointer;">
        <summary style="font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
          Do you only operate in Singapore?
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 300;">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px;">Our promoter roster and retail coverage is Singapore-based — NTUC, Cold Storage, Giant, Sheng Siong and major malls island-wide. For Malaysia and regional markets, reach out and we'll discuss options through our Elitez Group partners.</p>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const _sb = supabase.createClient(
    'https://rqqgrnttbelsxpmfikaa.supabase.co',
    'eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InJxcWdybnR0YmVsc3hwbWZpa2FhIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODA3ODYzNzIsImV4cCI6MjA5NjM2MjM3Mn0.cfSwq0ie2fsiwOgYYGgpS5WTj_eCZkYXJFntDNgbn94'
  );

  // Prefill from ?interest= (e.g. Blink page CTAs) — ticks the Blink box and seeds the brief
  (function prefillInterest() {
    const interest = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('interest');
    if (!interest) return;
    const blinkBox = document.querySelector('input[name="services"][value="blink"]');
    if (blinkBox) blinkBox.checked = true;
    const msg = document.querySelector('textarea[name="message"]');
    const seeds = {
      'blink-demo': "I'd like a live demo of the Blink client dashboard for one of our campaigns.",
      'blink-subscription': "We run our own promoter team and want to ask about a Blink subscription for our in-house operations.",
    };
    if (msg && seeds[interest] && !msg.value) msg.value = seeds[interest];
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    if (form) form.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
  })();

  document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', async function(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const btn = this.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
    btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
    btn.disabled = true;
    const fd = new FormData(this);
    const services = [...this.querySelectorAll('input[name="services"]:checked')].map(cb => cb.value).join(', ');

    // Save to Supabase (non-blocking — email still goes out even if this fails)
    try {
      await _sb.from('fmcg_enquiries').insert({
        first_name: fd.get('firstName') || '',
        last_name:  fd.get('lastName')  || '',
        company:    fd.get('company')   || '',
        email:      fd.get('email')     || '',
        phone:      fd.get('phone')     || '',
        service:    fd.get('service')   || '',
        services_checklist: services,
        message:    fd.get('message')   || '',
        status:     'new'
      });
    } catch(err) { console.warn('Enquiry save error:', err); }

    try {
      const res = await fetch('https://formsubmit.co/ajax/fmcg@elitez.asia', {
        method: 'POST',
        body: fd,
        headers: { 'Accept': 'application/json' }
      });
      if (res.ok) {
        document.getElementById('contactForm').style.display = 'none';
        document.getElementById('formSuccess').classList.add('show');
        window.scrollTo({ top: document.querySelector('.contact-form-side').offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });
        if (typeof posthog !== 'undefined') {
          posthog.capture('quote_form_submitted', {
            company: fd.get('company') || '',
            services_selected: services,
            has_phone: !!(fd.get('phone') || '').trim()
          });
        }
      } else { throw new Error(); }
    } catch {
      btn.textContent = 'Get a Proposal in 48hrs →';
      btn.disabled = false;
      alert('Something went wrong. Please email us at fmcg@elitez.asia or call +65 8180 0994.');
    }
  });
  const obs=new IntersectionObserver(es=>es.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('visible');obs.unobserve(e.target);}}),{threshold:0.1});document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el=>obs.observe(el));

  // PostHog — contact page events
  if (typeof posthog !== 'undefined') {
    posthog.capture('contact_page_viewed');

    document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="tel:"]').forEach(function(link) {
      link.addEventListener('click', function() {
        posthog.capture('phone_number_clicked', { number: link.getAttribute('href') });
      });
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="mailto:"]').forEach(function(link) {
      link.addEventListener('click', function() {
        posthog.capture('email_link_clicked');
      });
    });

    var linkedInLink = document.querySelector('a[href*="linkedin.com"]');
    if (linkedInLink) {
      linkedInLink.addEventListener('click', function() {
        posthog.capture('linkedin_clicked');
      });
    }
  }
</script>
<!-- Lenis smooth scroll + GSAP -->
</BaseLayout>
